Generic single-database configuration for Congress Trade Tracker.

## Usage

### Create a new migration
```bash
alembic revision -m "description of changes"
```

### Run migrations (upgrade to latest)
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Downgrade one revision
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

### Show current revision
```bash
alembic current
```

### Show migration history
```bash
alembic history
```

## Note

For the MVP, we're using the bootstrap_db.py script to initialize the schema.
Alembic is set up for future schema evolution when we need to migrate
existing databases without data loss.

When adding SQLAlchemy models, update alembic/env.py to import your Base
and set target_metadata = Base.metadata for autogenerate support.
